        "type": "game",
        "name": "Light and Sneak（轻灯慢步）",
        "steam_appid": 3691670,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is said to be one of the training games for astronauts in a certain village, which helps them to be at ease even when encountering not-so-friendly residents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a player, holding a flashlight, exploring the dark and seemingly labyrinthine areas. As you observe and utilize the patterns of the maze's materials and inhabitants, you will become more adept at uncovering its secrets. Play hide-and-seek, wander around, but don't get caught. That's it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold on to your flashlight switch and turn it off immediately when necessary to avoid alerting the guards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the twists and turns of the maze to shake off the guards chasing you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to get into a distant entrance, but the guards are always hanging around there? Well, try focusing the flashlight on them to lure them away, but you’d better have the next move in mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maze with only walls and guards would be incredibly boring. Wander around and look for interesting things. Make use of them and you might have a more enjoyable exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It wouldn’t be fun if everything was spelled out. Take your flashlight and start exploring!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is said to be one of the training games for astronauts in a certain village, which helps them to be at ease even when encountering not-so-friendly residents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a player, holding a flashlight, exploring the dark and seemingly labyrinthine areas. As you observe and utilize the patterns of the maze's materials and inhabitants, you will become more adept at uncovering its secrets. Play hide-and-seek, wander around, but don't get caught. That's it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold on to your flashlight switch and turn it off immediately when necessary to avoid alerting the guards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the twists and turns of the maze to shake off the guards chasing you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to get into a distant entrance, but the guards are always hanging around there? Well, try focusing the flashlight on them to lure them away, but you’d better have the next move in mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maze with only walls and guards would be incredibly boring. Wander around and look for interesting things. Make use of them and you might have a more enjoyable exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It wouldn’t be fun if everything was spelled out. Take your flashlight and start exploring!</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "You will play as a player, holding a flashlight, exploring the dark and seemingly labyrinthine areas. As you observe and utilize the patterns of the maze's materials and inhabitants, you will become more adept at uncovering its secrets. Play hide-and-seek, wander around, don't get caught. That's it.",
